[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……よし、これで全部ですね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...All right, that's everything!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんねー、レスナちゃん。\nポスター貼るの手伝ってもらっちゃって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry for making you help put up posters, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ！\u3000先輩方の力になれて光栄です！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not at all! I'm honored to be of help to my seniors!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に助かった。選挙委員に依頼したら、事前に\n申請したもの以外は受け付けられないと言われてな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You really saved us. When I asked the election committee, they said they wouldn't accept anything that hadn't been approved in advance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "普通は貼り直しなどしないのだろう。\nロロナも、私のわがままに付き合わせてすまない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Normally people don't redo their posters. Rorona, I apologize for involving you in this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫だよ。\n前よりもっといいポスターになったと思う！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry about it! I think the posters turned out even better than before!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「私と共に、夢を探そう」……か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\"Let's search for our dreams together\"... huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（だ、誰！？\u3000顔が隠れてて分からないけど……\n\u3000どこかで見たことがあるような気も……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(W-who is that?! I can't see their face, but... they seem familiar somehow...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……くだらないな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...How mundane."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "外部への留学を経験し、少しは成長しているかと\n期待したが……君には失望したよ、ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had hoped your study abroad experience might have helped you mature... but I'm disappointed in you, Juna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょ、ちょっと！\u3000勝手なこと言わないでください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hey! Don't say things like that out of nowhere!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あ！\u3000どこかで見覚えがあると思ったら、\nこの人って生徒会長候補の……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ah! I thought they looked familiar. This person is one of the student council president candidates...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いかにも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はロマン。\n今回の生徒会選、私がいただかせてもらうよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm Roman. This student council election is all but mine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この学園は夢ある者たちのためにある。\n確かな夢を持たない君が、生徒会長になる資格はない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This academy exists for those who have dreams. Someone like you who lacks one has no right to serve as student council president."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうかもしれません。ですが、それを決めるのは\nあなたではありません。生徒の投票です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Perhaps you're right. But that's not for you to decide. That's up to the students!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "同じことだよ。生徒会長に選ばれるのは私だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The outcome will be the same. I'm the one who will be chosen as student council president."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "し、失礼な人ー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "T-that was rude!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "絶対勝ちましょうね、ユナ先輩！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry, you've got this, Miss Juna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……あれ？\u3000そういえば、ユナ先輩、\n\u3000あの人に敬語で話してたよね）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Wait a minute... Come to think of it, Miss Juna was speaking formally to that person.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（３年の先輩は立候補できないはずだけど……\n\u3000ロマンさんって、いったい何者！？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Third-year students shouldn't be able to run for office... Who in the world is this Roman person?!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]